(text "OUT=FB: unity tracking. ADJ reference+enable; no fault GPIO exists.\nInput/output abs45V: upstream clamp and cable-inductance overshoot tests required.\nAt14V/5V,100mA dissipates about0.9W per tracker;300mA about2.7W. Neither is a qualified load budget.\nGround return links are NOT fuses. Star placement, ground offset, thermal, cold crank and fault tests block release." (at 25.4 365 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bf8210b3-002b-524d-972a-bb2ef048e69d"))
